# OneBin Environment Configuration
#
# ZERO API KEYS REQUIRED!
# OneBin runs 100% on-device in the browser using onnxruntime-web (WebAssembly).
# No external AI API keys (Google Gemini, OpenAI, etc.) are needed to run or build the app.
#
# Optional: Supabase Realtime Telemetry (for live demo leaderboard/stats)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key
